# This repo is edited on Windows but the deployment targets are Linux, where the same
# bytes are executed. A shell script with CRLF fails as `bash\r: bad interpreter` inside
# the EC2 user-data step, which is the worst possible place to discover it.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.tpl text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.tf text eol=lf
*.tfvars text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
